anc et or avec bibliothèque, bureau et fenêtre ouverte sur les flèches de la capitale.","sc":1,"line":73,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s0lecr1a","k":"s","text":"Résidence des Jardins suspendus","sc":1,"line":74,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s0w93qtk","k":"s","text":"Une résidence élégante où les bannières impériales rencontrent un confort réellement privé.","sc":1,"line":74,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s1xa12tz","k":"s","text":"Suite de la Cour solaire","sc":1,"line":75,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s01h6eq6","k":"s","text":"Une vaste suite de réception assez prestigieuse pour accueillir la haute cour sans lui céder votre intimité.","sc":1,"line":75,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s1wrhykv","k":"s","text":"Domaine du Phénix","sc":1,"line":76,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s06cd791","k":"s","text":"Un palais résidentiel baigné de soleil, avec salons, balcon et chambre monumentale au-dessus d’Al’Gratal.","sc":1,"line":76,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s0563wmz","k":"s","text":"Chambre des Docks","sc":1,"line":78,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s1w917pd","k":"s","text":"Un refuge de pierre et de bois au-dessus du port, rude mais sec, où les cloches remplacent les horloges.","sc":1,"line":78,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s0d8nihl","k":"s","text":"Logis du Guetteur","sc":1,"line":79,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s1toqt78","k":"s","text":"Une chambre fonctionnelle avec bureau de navigation et vue directe sur les murailles du port.","sc":1,"line":79,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s1pzol9r","k":"s","text":"Appartement de la Ville Haute","sc":1,"line":80,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s0rtxw0h","k":"s","text":"Boiseries sombres, tentures bleues et terrasse : la mer entre ici sans le vacarme des quais.","sc":1,"line":80,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s13dm6vh","k":"s","text":"Suite de l’Amirauté","sc":1,"line":81,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s019lpsh","k":"s","text"