i l’Empire ni la cour : seulement une femme ayant choisi d’écrire en son nom.","sc":12,"line":107,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s03d6vey","k":"s","text":"Gantelet ouvert d’Allenna","sc":13,"line":108,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s15udjxf","k":"s","text":"Un gantelet d’entraînement dont la paume a été volontairement découpée pour rappeler qu’une main peut protéger sans saisir.","sc":13,"line":108,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s11v2vku","k":"s","text":"Boussole de relève","sc":14,"line":109,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s08mfepi","k":"s","text":"Une ancienne boussole de Forthaven dont Draven a confié l’aiguille à la génération qui commande désormais.","sc":14,"line":109,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s0z74d4f","k":"s","text":"Photophore de givre","sc":16,"line":113,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s17atk0e","k":"s","text":"La flamme ne chauffe pas, mais sa neige intérieure change avec l’humeur de la pièce.","sc":16,"line":113,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s1rvmudd","k":"s","text":"Signet de Remerii","sc":17,"line":114,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s1260gz8","k":"s","text":"Un signet de métal fin apporté lors de sa première visite au logis. Remerii vous a prié d’épargner désormais les coins des pages.","sc":17,"line":114,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s1sckwjl","k":"s","text":"Oiseau mécanique sans blason","sc":18,"line":115,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s0olq99m","k":"s","text":"Un petit oiseau de marché qui chante faux avec une assurance parfaitement apolitique.","sc":18,"line":115,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s1lblilk","k":"s","text":"Carte blanche de Valurn","sc":19,"line":116,"role":"name"},{"id":"housing-data:s0nyxui7","k":"s","text":"Une carte sans règle, sans mise et sans signature, pliée une seule fois au milieu.","sc":19,"line":116,"role":"description"},{"id":"housing-data:s10j8anr","k":"s","text":"Lanterne à luciole illusoire","sc":20,"line":117,"role":"name"},{"id"